        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions KTL100SS4, Mitered Kettle Stainless Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel Kettle Door Pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. This mitered door pull is easy to care for. Because it is made out of stainless steel, it will stand up to heavy use in commercial settings. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions KTL100SS4 1\" Diameter Stainless Steel Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-KTL01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262336\"><b>First Impressions KTL100SS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>KTL100012SS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>KTL100024SS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 23\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>KTL100036SS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 35\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Kettle Door Pull",
                "description": "The Stainless Steel Kettle Door Pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors. This mitered door pull is easy to care for. Because it is made out of stainless steel, it will stand up to heavy use in commercial settings.",
